          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">The </span></span><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">STERIZONE VP4 Sterilizer</span></span></span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"> is compatible with more than 4,600 devices. Use our online compatibility matrix to see if it meets your needs.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n",
